    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="490" rules="ROWS">
      <col width="235">
      <col width="238">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="481">
          <p class="western">
             <b>Use case: Cleaning window message</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="481">
          <p class="western">
             <b>Comment:</b> This use case is initiated by the user when he/she wants to delete the
            contents of the message window.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="481">
          <p class="western">
             <b>Actor: User</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p class="western">
             <b>Normal course</b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p class="western">
             <b>Alternative courses</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" class="western" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user indicates to the window messages that he/she wants to clean
            its content.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" class="western" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.1.If the message window is not visible, the user must execute the use
            case S<i>etting window message at front.</i></font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" class="western" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The program cleans the content of the message window.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" class="western" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
